  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Capacitiesfor NFMS and FREL management and development in PNG</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To enable the continuation of support to PNG?s REDD+ Readiness Phase, to strengthen capacities for the efficient management of REDD+, to develop a National REDD+ strategy, support the continuation of the country?s considerable achievements on NFMS, FREL and safeguards, and to increase engagement of diverse stakeholders (government, private sector, NGOs/CSOs and academia) in this process.</narrative>
  </description>
